   "version": 1,
   "text": "\"Continue those drums first, then bring back the original kick and bass\n naturally without restarting.\"\n\"... avoid new headline synth melodies.\"\n\"... one understated break, extended mixable kick-and-percussion outro.\"\n\"No vocals, EDM drops, big risers or genre jumps.\"",
   "originalText": "\"Continue those drums first, then bring back the original kick and bass\n naturally without restarting.\"\n\"... avoid new headline synth melodies.\"\n\"... one understated break, extended mixable kick-and-percussion outro.\"\n\"No vocals, EDM drops, big risers or genre jumps.\"",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
